1
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,079
Tong Chunhai,

2
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:49,500
who tipped you off

3
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:50,739
about the Young Mistress?

4
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:52,859
Kill me if you've got the nerve.

5
00:01:53,659 --> 00:01:55,459
Bring on whatever else you've got.

6
00:01:56,340 --> 00:01:58,079
I'm enjoying this.

7
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,359
You really think I can't

8
00:02:02,359 --> 00:02:03,359
touch you?

9
00:02:05,319 --> 00:02:06,719
You don't care about your own life.

10
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:08,879
But what about

11
00:02:08,879 --> 00:02:10,000
the rest of your family?

12
00:02:23,460 --> 00:02:24,699
Think twice before you answer.

13
00:02:38,460 --> 00:02:40,319
Yu Changxuan,

14
00:02:41,659 --> 00:02:43,039
didn't you know

15
00:02:43,819 --> 00:02:45,699
a jealous woman

16
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:48,120
will stop at nothing?

17
00:04:00,599 --> 00:04:01,439
You came.

18
00:04:03,439 --> 00:04:04,800
I've been waiting so long.

19
00:04:05,939 --> 00:04:07,580
When did you start smoking opium?

20
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:32,339
You know

21
00:04:33,519 --> 00:04:35,279
how long these nights are?

22
00:04:35,540 --> 00:04:36,939
So cold it gets into your bones.

23
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,360
I'd lie awake counting the hours

24
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:42,379
and listening to the wind.

25
00:04:43,660 --> 00:04:45,060
But time crawled

26
00:04:46,639 --> 00:04:47,959
so slowly

27
00:04:51,019 --> 00:04:53,199
that it drove me mad.

28
00:04:55,100 --> 00:04:55,959
Then

29
00:04:57,060 --> 00:04:58,220
I found opium,

30
00:04:59,459 --> 00:05:02,959
and all the worry, the pain,

31
00:05:05,779 --> 00:05:06,600
the waiting

32
00:05:09,500 --> 00:05:10,519
just went away.

33
00:05:14,220 --> 00:05:15,500
Tong Chunhai told me

34
00:05:17,620 --> 00:05:18,420
you only made the deal

35
00:05:18,420 --> 00:05:19,680
because of the opium.

36
00:05:21,519 --> 00:05:22,319
I know

37
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,220
you had no choice.

38
00:05:25,759 --> 00:05:26,560
No choice?

39
00:05:30,500 --> 00:05:31,399
You think

40
00:05:31,819 --> 00:05:33,620
this was just a deal?

41
00:05:36,500 --> 00:05:38,480
When Tong Chunhai came to me,

42
00:05:39,819 --> 00:05:42,100
I was already hooked.

43
00:05:43,019 --> 00:05:44,699
But working with him

44
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,600
was a chance

45
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:50,420
to make Ye Pingjun

46
00:05:50,420 --> 00:05:52,120
disappear for good.

47
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:00,879
Why did you do that?

48
00:06:06,899 --> 00:06:07,720
Why?

49
00:06:09,199 --> 00:06:10,819
Because as long as

50
00:06:11,439 --> 00:06:12,459
she's around,

51
00:06:12,879 --> 00:06:14,879
you'll never come to hear me sing again.

52
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:16,759
I won't be the one

53
00:06:16,759 --> 00:06:18,000
you talk to anymore.

54
00:06:19,100 --> 00:06:19,639
You'll never

55
00:06:19,639 --> 00:06:20,779
tell me, over and over,

56
00:06:20,779 --> 00:06:22,379
to keep living.

57
00:06:24,819 --> 00:06:25,939
With her gone,

58
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:28,939
it'd be just you and me again.

59
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,579
Do you know

60
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,420
Pingjun was worried

61
00:06:50,819 --> 00:06:52,939
about you first after she was rescued?

62
00:06:54,740 --> 00:06:56,720
She was afraid you were in danger too.

63
00:06:59,819 --> 00:07:01,379
That silly girl...

64
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,600
Maybe

65
00:07:08,199 --> 00:07:09,860
you should never have saved me.

66
00:07:12,500 --> 00:07:13,879
Maybe I should've

67
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:18,439
died back then.

68
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:22,879
What's done is done.

69
00:07:25,079 --> 00:07:26,139
I don't regret it.

70
00:07:32,060 --> 00:07:33,319
Kill me. Go on.

71
00:08:11,740 --> 00:08:12,639
Just shoot.

72
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:17,199
I owe Ye Pingjun,

73
00:08:20,540 --> 00:08:21,860
and I'll pay with my life.

74
00:08:46,600 --> 00:08:47,980
Why?

75
00:08:59,340 --> 00:09:00,000
Lan Qing,

76
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:03,000
look at me.

77
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:05,500
I'm

78
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:08,220
not him.

79
00:09:15,879 --> 00:09:17,340
That's all long over.

80
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:22,279
It's time to face it.

81
00:10:11,500 --> 00:10:11,899
Don't move!

82
00:10:12,519 --> 00:10:13,000
On your feet!

83
00:10:13,659 --> 00:10:14,059
Get up!

84
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:14,600
Up!

85
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,000
Stay put!

86
00:10:15,700 --> 00:10:16,259
Take those crates!

87
00:10:16,919 --> 00:10:17,220
Get out!

88
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,220
You too!

89
00:10:19,299 --> 00:10:20,100
Ever since my father

90
00:10:20,100 --> 00:10:21,220
took over Nanhuai,

91
00:10:21,779 --> 00:10:23,320
opium has been banned in this city.

92
00:10:24,259 --> 00:10:25,000
Now

93
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:26,259
there are

94
00:10:26,259 --> 00:10:27,460
underground dens

95
00:10:27,460 --> 00:10:28,659
here,

96
00:10:29,340 --> 00:10:30,759
and our own soldiers and officers

97
00:10:31,500 --> 00:10:32,580
are regulars.

98
00:10:32,740 --> 00:10:33,500
Move it! Go!

99
00:10:33,799 --> 00:10:34,559
I believe

100
00:10:35,019 --> 00:10:36,200
someone high up

101
00:10:36,700 --> 00:10:38,639
in the Yu Army is behind it.

102
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,379
Every pipe lit

103
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,120
ruins a life.

104
00:10:43,539 --> 00:10:45,000
Every box of opium sold

105
00:10:45,379 --> 00:10:46,700
drives a family

106
00:10:47,159 --> 00:10:48,039
to sell children.

107
00:10:49,879 --> 00:10:50,799
Starting today,

108
00:10:51,539 --> 00:10:53,220
pull the best men from each battalion

109
00:10:53,759 --> 00:10:54,879
into a task force

110
00:10:55,340 --> 00:10:57,000
and shut down every opium den.

111
00:10:57,759 --> 00:10:58,899
Any officer protecting them

112
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,120
will be shot.

113
00:11:18,759 --> 00:11:19,980
My car's just up ahead.

114
00:11:20,059 --> 00:11:20,919
Let me give you a ride.

115
00:11:21,100 --> 00:11:23,240
No need. I'll just get a rickshaw.

116
00:11:24,539 --> 00:11:25,480
Then I'll wait with you.

117
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,220
What are you doing?

118
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:00,940
Kuang Bingwen!

119
00:12:01,259 --> 00:12:02,059
Kuang Bingwen!

120
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:05,940
Kuang Bingwen,

121
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:06,779
stop it!

122
00:12:07,100 --> 00:12:07,779
Just stop.

123
00:12:08,059 --> 00:12:08,779
Stop it.

124
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:18,799
Kuang Bingwen,

125
00:12:19,399 --> 00:12:20,100
stop the car.

126
00:12:21,620 --> 00:12:22,320
Stop!

127
00:12:39,779 --> 00:12:40,580
Yu Jinxuan,

128
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:42,279
for years I've

129
00:12:43,740 --> 00:12:45,539
bent over backwards for you.

130
00:12:46,379 --> 00:12:47,299
I've never said a word

131
00:12:47,299 --> 00:12:48,240
you didn't want to hear.

132
00:12:48,940 --> 00:12:49,620
Never done a thing

133
00:12:49,620 --> 00:12:50,539
you didn't like.

134
00:12:50,740 --> 00:12:51,799
But you've never

135
00:12:52,879 --> 00:12:54,779
really looked at me.

136
00:12:55,179 --> 00:12:56,940
I'm invisible to you,

137
00:12:57,600 --> 00:12:58,899
and you'd rather pine

138
00:12:58,899 --> 00:13:00,340
for a dead man.

139
00:13:00,580 --> 00:13:01,440
And now

140
00:13:02,559 --> 00:13:04,379
any man off the street

141
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:05,679
can get cozy

142
00:13:05,679 --> 00:13:06,779
with you?

143
00:13:17,299 --> 00:13:18,100
Kuang Bingwen,

144
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:20,379
I'll hate you for this.

145
00:13:20,379 --> 00:13:21,980
You never wanted to marry me.

146
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:23,539
You've hated me since our

147
00:13:23,679 --> 00:13:24,679
wedding day.

148
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:26,139
I might as well

149
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:28,879
give you every reason to.

150
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,179
Don't forget,

151
00:14:18,720 --> 00:14:19,799
you belong to me.

152
00:14:20,679 --> 00:14:21,679
You're my wife,

153
00:14:22,639 --> 00:14:23,639
and that

154
00:14:24,759 --> 00:14:26,299
will never change.

155
00:14:29,019 --> 00:14:30,240
Kuang Bingwen,

156
00:14:32,299 --> 00:14:33,960
one day I'll

157
00:14:35,799 --> 00:14:37,879
make you regret this.

158
00:14:42,840 --> 00:14:44,320
I can't wait to

159
00:14:45,259 --> 00:14:46,799
see you try.

160
00:15:14,159 --> 00:15:14,799
Let me help.

161
00:15:15,340 --> 00:15:16,419
Go rest for a bit.

162
00:15:17,159 --> 00:15:18,019
I've got it.

163
00:15:18,720 --> 00:15:20,419
An injury like yours takes months to heal.

164
00:15:20,820 --> 00:15:22,139
You've barely rested.

165
00:15:30,279 --> 00:15:31,220
Thank you

166
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:33,960
for coming home with me.

167
00:15:46,860 --> 00:15:47,679
Don't worry.

168
00:15:49,159 --> 00:15:51,360
My mom and sisters are easy

169
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,019
to get along with.

170
00:15:54,620 --> 00:15:56,080
If anything comes up,

171
00:15:56,220 --> 00:15:57,159
just tell me.

172
00:15:57,759 --> 00:15:58,779
A husband's

173
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:01,820
supposed to have his wife's back.

174
00:16:05,580 --> 00:16:06,620
Even if, for now,

175
00:16:07,519 --> 00:16:08,700
I'm only your husband in name.

176
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:16,059
I'll be a good wife.

177
00:16:21,460 --> 00:16:22,259
Oh,

178
00:16:23,700 --> 00:16:24,600
can I bring Tang

179
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:25,659
with me?

180
00:16:26,620 --> 00:16:27,419
Of course.

181
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:30,320
Whatever you want.

182
00:16:43,820 --> 00:16:44,720
There's

183
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,320
something you should know.

184
00:16:50,139 --> 00:16:51,279
Lan Qing had a hand

185
00:16:53,159 --> 00:16:54,500
in what Tong Chunhai did to you.

186
00:16:55,679 --> 00:16:56,759
Lan Qing?

187
00:16:59,639 --> 00:17:00,440
Why would she do that?

188
00:17:00,580 --> 00:17:01,259
Because of me.

189
00:17:04,019 --> 00:17:04,859
You?

190
00:17:06,279 --> 00:17:07,440
Well,

191
00:17:08,519 --> 00:17:09,759
not exactly.

192
00:17:13,619 --> 00:17:14,640
Ten years ago,

193
00:17:16,319 --> 00:17:17,559
she wasn't

194
00:17:19,920 --> 00:17:20,720
the famous

195
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:22,220
opera star she is today.

196
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:30,339
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

197
00:17:32,220 --> 00:17:33,059
Look at her grace on stage.

198
00:17:33,319 --> 00:17:34,579
No wonder she's the leading lady.

199
00:17:34,660 --> 00:17:35,279
Exactly.

200
00:17:39,819 --> 00:17:40,660
Just you wait.

201
00:17:40,859 --> 00:17:42,700
One day I'll be a star too.

202
00:17:47,660 --> 00:17:48,880
[That was when]

203
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:51,599
[she met my eldest brother, Yu Mingxuan.]

204
00:17:59,240 --> 00:18:00,680
Relax, I won't hurt you.

205
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:06,079
Get lost.

206
00:18:08,279 --> 00:18:08,980
This isn't over!

207
00:18:13,519 --> 00:18:14,680
Thank you, sir.

208
00:18:15,920 --> 00:18:17,019
We've met before.

209
00:18:17,660 --> 00:18:18,660
What's your name?

210
00:18:19,559 --> 00:18:20,759
I don't have one.

211
00:18:21,460 --> 00:18:22,759
The troupe owner calls me Qing.

212
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:25,759
Qing?

213
00:18:48,240 --> 00:18:52,880
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

214
00:18:53,079 --> 00:18:54,960
Zhang Chang, a Han official,

215
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,119
used to paint his wife's eyebrows.

216
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:01,160
He said couples share

217
00:19:02,420 --> 00:19:03,759
sweeter joys than that.

218
00:19:07,359 --> 00:19:08,720
You're a painting come to life.

219
00:19:16,160 --> 00:19:17,359
Mingxuan.

220
00:19:31,920 --> 00:19:32,819
Lan Qing.

221
00:19:44,519 --> 00:19:45,319
Lan

222
00:19:46,019 --> 00:19:47,420
means orchid, the noblest of flowers.

223
00:19:48,279 --> 00:19:50,980
Qing means a fair lady.

224
00:19:53,359 --> 00:19:55,079
Lan Qing.

225
00:19:57,220 --> 00:19:58,259
It's beautiful.

226
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:03,099
I love the name you gave me.

227
00:20:04,259 --> 00:20:05,420
Now I finally

228
00:20:06,279 --> 00:20:07,880
have a name of my own.

229
00:20:12,279 --> 00:20:13,519
Mingxuan.

230
00:20:14,859 --> 00:20:16,160
Lan Qing.

231
00:20:36,759 --> 00:20:37,880
Please

232
00:20:38,619 --> 00:20:39,680
take care of yourself.

233
00:20:41,819 --> 00:20:42,759
Have a safe journey.

234
00:20:44,559 --> 00:20:45,359
I have to go.

235
00:21:09,059 --> 00:21:10,119
So after that,

236
00:21:12,160 --> 00:21:14,119
she just waited for him to come back?

237
00:21:17,799 --> 00:21:19,599
He was gone three years.

238
00:21:22,279 --> 00:21:24,819
My father faked a serious illness

239
00:21:26,500 --> 00:21:28,000
and wired him to come home.

240
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:32,500
When he got back to Nanhuai,

241
00:21:33,059 --> 00:21:34,279
he found out it was a trick.

242
00:21:37,059 --> 00:21:37,920
I'm sorry, Father.

243
00:21:38,539 --> 00:21:39,460
I can't say yes.

244
00:21:40,099 --> 00:21:40,900
I promised Lan Qing

245
00:21:40,900 --> 00:21:41,720
I'd marry her.

246
00:21:42,319 --> 00:21:43,420
I won't go back on my word.

247
00:21:44,380 --> 00:21:45,180
Nonsense!

248
00:21:46,079 --> 00:21:47,900
My son is

249
00:21:49,319 --> 00:21:50,119
marrying

250
00:21:50,119 --> 00:21:51,640
a lowly opera girl?

251
00:21:52,220 --> 00:21:52,819
No one

252
00:21:52,819 --> 00:21:54,279
is born better than anyone else.

253
00:21:55,059 --> 00:21:57,059
With her

254
00:21:57,059 --> 00:21:59,059
talent and strength,

255
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:00,740
she's far nobler

256
00:22:01,299 --> 00:22:03,019
than those who have nothing

257
00:22:03,420 --> 00:22:04,359
but a family name.

258
00:22:05,660 --> 00:22:07,960
I sent you abroad to study,

259
00:22:08,119 --> 00:22:10,160
and all you learned was clever talk?

260
00:22:10,819 --> 00:22:12,920
Or would you rather that opera girl

261
00:22:12,920 --> 00:22:15,259
just vanished?

262
00:22:19,680 --> 00:22:20,420
Father,

263
00:22:21,319 --> 00:22:22,859
why are you doing this to me?

264
00:22:24,059 --> 00:22:25,059
Mingxuan,

265
00:22:27,079 --> 00:22:28,859
you've always been a good son.

266
00:22:29,319 --> 00:22:30,279
You never once defied me.

267
00:22:30,279 --> 00:22:31,200
I'll do anything

268
00:22:31,200 --> 00:22:32,119
you ask,

269
00:22:33,220 --> 00:22:34,460
but not this.

270
00:22:34,859 --> 00:22:35,859
If you want to see

271
00:22:35,859 --> 00:22:37,960
the streets of Nanhuai run red with blood,

272
00:22:38,420 --> 00:22:39,299
just go.

273
00:22:42,519 --> 00:22:44,420
The regime that wants an emperor back

274
00:22:44,880 --> 00:22:47,880
is backing the Wan Army to take Nanhuai.

275
00:22:48,279 --> 00:22:50,920
100,000 troops are massed outside the city.

276
00:22:51,720 --> 00:22:54,319
If it falls, it'll be a massacre.

277
00:22:58,059 --> 00:22:59,700
Vice Minister Jun's brother is

278
00:22:59,980 --> 00:23:01,359
the envoy to the United States.

279
00:23:02,519 --> 00:23:03,559
The Jun family controls

280
00:23:03,559 --> 00:23:05,880
arms purchases from America.

281
00:23:06,420 --> 00:23:07,880
One word from the Juns,

282
00:23:08,740 --> 00:23:10,420
and the Wan Army will have to back off.

283
00:23:12,960 --> 00:23:14,559
So the marriage is the price?

284
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:20,680
Mingxuan,

285
00:23:23,180 --> 00:23:24,779
you're the eldest son of this family.

286
00:23:29,039 --> 00:23:29,960
I know

287
00:23:30,960 --> 00:23:32,960
you like that opera girl.

288
00:23:34,019 --> 00:23:35,700
But weigh your own feelings

289
00:23:35,839 --> 00:23:37,539
against a whole city

290
00:23:39,359 --> 00:23:41,480
and the survival of this family.

291
00:23:42,859 --> 00:23:43,920
Which matters more?

292
00:24:24,299 --> 00:24:25,000
[Lan Qing,]

293
00:24:27,019 --> 00:24:27,900
[I'm sorry.]

294
00:24:30,299 --> 00:24:31,839
[I broke my promise and married]

295
00:24:32,660 --> 00:24:33,759
[someone else.]

296
00:24:36,079 --> 00:24:37,539
[I don't expect you to forgive me.]

297
00:24:38,460 --> 00:24:39,700
[But my heart]

298
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:43,339
[has always]

299
00:24:44,480 --> 00:24:45,980
[been yours, and it always]

